{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#card-zh","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 是面向 DSH Web 与 Desktop 的嵌入式浏览器插件：在侧栏打开多标签浏览面板，并由宿主端 Chromium 渲染网页。用户可输入网址或搜索、前进后退、查看工作区文件、为页面区域添加批注，也可在工作区中查看预览并编辑源码。Agent 可打开网页供用户查看、提取静态网页文字，或读取用户提交的页面批注并在处理后标记完成。适合需要在 DSH 对话中查阅网页、预览项目页面和反馈界面问题的开发者。使用前需在宿主机安装 Chromium、Chrome 或 Edge；无须 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:32"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#card-en","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Browser adds a multi-tab panel to DSH Web and Desktop using host-installed Chromium. Browse sites, inspect workspace files, annotate pages, and edit project source. Agents can open URLs, read static HTML, and process reviews. Requires Chromium, Chrome, or Edge; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:32"]}
