{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-1","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「多标签浏览」：面板支持新建、切换、关闭标签及前进、后退和刷新；标签按工作区保存到浏览器本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/store.ts:78"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-2","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「Agent 打开网页」：Agent 调用 browser_open 并传入 HTTP(S) 地址，已连接的 GUI 面板会打开该页面；没有面板连接时会返回未打开状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/tools.ts:238"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-3","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「读取网页文字」：Agent 调用 browser_read 获取静态 HTML 的标题和正文文本，可限制返回字符数；不执行页面 JavaScript。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/tools.ts:278"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-4","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「工作区文件浏览」：起始页可列出工作区文件并通过宿主路由查看文件内容，文件路径由工作区访问边界处理。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/api.ts:50"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-5","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「页面区域批注」：用户可在网页中选取区域并填写评论，提交后附上页面截图，作为批注批次发送给当前 Agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:177"]}
{"unit_id":"Nono-neko__dsh-browser#feature-6","repo":"Nono-neko/dsh-browser","commit":"3b30aa740ece9cc2057cb9c81bf1e5df5f1bef3e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Browser 的功能「批注处理」：Agent 使用 browser_review 查看已提交批注、页面位置和上下文，修改验证后调用 browser_review_resolve 标记评论已解决。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/review-tools.ts:38"]}
